<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Maintenance — <%= storeName %></title>
<style>
  :root{color-scheme:dark}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
  body{background:#07090f;color:#e5e7eb;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;
    background-image:radial-gradient(60% 40% at 50% 0%,rgba(6,182,212,.14),transparent 70%)}
  .card{width:100%;max-width:420px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:20px;padding:32px 24px}
  .logo{max-width:180px;max-height:56px;margin:0 auto 20px;display:block}
  .ico{width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 16px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(251,191,36,.12);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.3)}
  h1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px}
  p{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#9ca3af;white-space:pre-line}
  a.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:#06b6d4;color:#00131a;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}
  a.ghost{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <% if (logoUrl) { %><img class="logo" src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="<%= storeName %>"><% } %>
    <div class="ico">
      <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h1>Sedang Maintenance</h1>
    <p><%= message || 'Kami sedang melakukan perbaikan agar layanan lebih baik. Silakan kembali lagi beberapa saat lagi.' %></p>
    <a class="btn" href="javascript:location.reload()">Muat Ulang</a>
    <a class="ghost" href="/cek-pesanan">Cek Pesanan</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
